.TH SDL_InsertGPUDebugLabel 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_InsertGPUDebugLabel \- Inserts an arbitrary string label into the command buffer callstream.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gpu.h>
.PP
.BI "void SDL_InsertGPUDebugLabel(
.BI "    SDL_GPUCommandBuffer *command_buffer,
.BI "    const char *text);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Useful for debugging\[char46]
.PP
On Direct3D 12, using
.BR SDL_InsertGPUDebugLabel
requires WinPixEventRuntime\[char46]dll to be in your PATH or in the same directory as your executable\[char46] See
.URL https://devblogs.microsoft.com/pix/winpixeventruntime/ here
for instructions on how to obtain it\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I command_buffer
a command buffer\[char46]
.TP
.I text
a UTF-8 string constant to insert as the label\[char46]
.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

